    "detailed_description": "<strong>Crystal Survivor</strong> is a top-down roguelite arena shooter.<br>Use the crystal's unique attack methods, various weapons, items, and relics to survive and defeat the boss that awaits at the end of the wave.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811040/extras/b9e117a9d01acb2e12ec1c8aa8ab348a.poster.avif?t=1727096454\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811040/extras/b9e117a9d01acb2e12ec1c8aa8ab348a.webm?t=1727096454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811040/extras/b9e117a9d01acb2e12ec1c8aa8ab348a.mp4?t=1727096454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game content\u25c6</h2>Defeat the numerous approaching enemies with <strong>charged shots</strong>, collect EXP and coins, and strengthen your crystals!<br>Beautiful crystals give different special effects depending on their color.<br>Find original customizations and conquer the stages.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811040/extras/5bb89eb5690caed709cb896c09f241cb.poster.avif?t=1727096454\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811040/extras/5bb89eb5690caed709cb896c09f241cb.webm?t=1727096454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811040/extras/5bb89eb5690caed709cb896c09f241cb.mp4?t=1727096454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Earn bonus coins by eliminating enemies and advancing the wave faster!<br>Unlock new crystals and character enhancements with the coins you collect.<br>Coin refunds are always free. Try out new upgrades.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Online ranking\u25c6</h2>Compete against players from all over the world in online rankings.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> &quot;Destroy Mode&quot; Compete for time to defeat 1,000 enemies as quickly as possible.<br></li><li> &quot;Endless mode&quot; Survive the never-ending wave as long as possible.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Story\u25c6</h2>An army of evil monsters approaches to steal the sacred crystal...<br>Well...<br>Use the power of crystals to defeat evil enemies and restore peace to the world.<br>...Maybe it's like that.",
